---
{
  title: "query_num"
}
---
### NAME

    query_num()

### SYNOPSIS

    varargs string query_num( int x, int many: (: 0 :) );

### PARAMETERS

    x     (int)
          The number to convert to a string.

    many  (int, optional, default: 0)
          If 1, the number will be returned in plural form.

### RETURN VALUES

    (string) The number in string form.
